---
const isEnglish = Astro.currentLocale === "en";

const content = isEnglish
  ? {
      label: "Process",
      title: "A clear process makes better products.",
      intro:
        "Good digital work does not begin with code. It begins with understanding what needs to be built, why it matters and what the simplest effective solution looks like.",
      phases: [
        {
          number: "01",
          title: "Understand",
          subtitle: "The problem comes first.",
          description:
            "Before choosing a technology or defining a solution, I try to understand the context. What needs to be solved? Who will use the product? Which constraints, goals and processes matter?",
          points: [
            "Goals and requirements",
            "Users and context",
            "Existing processes",
            "Technical constraints",
          ],
        },
        {
          number: "02",
          title: "Define",
          subtitle: "Turn complexity into direction.",
          description:
            "Once the problem is clear, I define the structure of the solution. I identify what is essential, what can be simplified and which technologies are actually useful for the project.",
          points: [
            "Information architecture",
            "Features and priorities",
            "Technical approach",
            "Project structure",
          ],
        },
        {
          number: "03",
          title: "Design",
          subtitle: "Make the solution understandable.",
          description:
            "Design is not only about appearance. It is about creating an interface and an experience that make the product clear, coherent and easy to use.",
          points: [
            "Interface and visual language",
            "User experience",
            "Responsive behaviour",
            "Interaction patterns",
          ],
        },
        {
          number: "04",
          title: "Build",
          subtitle: "Turn the idea into something real.",
          description:
            "I develop the product using the technologies that best fit the problem. The focus is on clean architecture, reliable behaviour and code that can evolve with the project.",
          points: [
            "Frontend development",
            "Backend and APIs",
            "Database and integrations",
            "Testing and refinement",
          ],
        },
        {
          number: "05",
          title: "Refine",
          subtitle: "Good work continues after launch.",
          description:
            "Once the product is working, I look at what can be improved. Performance, usability, content, technical details and future needs all become part of the next iteration.",
          points: [
            "Testing and feedback",
            "Performance",
            "SEO and accessibility",
            "Future improvements",
          ],
        },
      ],
      closingTitle: "No unnecessary steps.",
      closingText:
        "The process adapts to the project. A simple website does not need the same workflow as a complex web application. What remains constant is the attention to the problem, the people and the result.",
      ctaTitle: "Let's build something useful.",
      ctaText:
        "If you have an idea, a problem to solve or a process that could work better, let's start there.",
      ctaButton: "Start a conversation",
    }
  : {
      label: "Processo",
      title: "Un processo chiaro porta a prodotti migliori.",
      intro:
        "Un buon lavoro digitale non comincia dal codice. Comincia dalla comprensione di ciò che deve essere costruito, del perché sia importante e di quale sia la soluzione più semplice per farlo funzionare davvero.",
      phases: [
        {
          number: "01",
          title: "Capire",
          subtitle: "Prima viene il problema.",
          description:
            "Prima di scegliere una tecnologia o definire una soluzione, cerco di capire il contesto. Cosa deve essere risolto? Chi utilizzerà il prodotto? Quali vincoli, obiettivi e processi contano davvero?",
          points: [
            "Obiettivi e requisiti",
            "Persone e contesto",
            "Processi esistenti",
            "Vincoli tecnici",
          ],
        },
        {
          number: "02",
          title: "Definire",
          subtitle: "Trasformare la complessità in una direzione.",
          description:
            "Quando il problema è chiaro, definisco la struttura della soluzione. Individuo ciò che è essenziale, ciò che può essere semplificato e quali tecnologie sono realmente utili per il progetto.",
          points: [
            "Architettura dei contenuti",
            "Funzionalità e priorità",
            "Approccio tecnico",
            "Struttura del progetto",
          ],
        },
        {
          number: "03",
          title: "Progettare",
          subtitle: "Rendere la soluzione comprensibile.",
          description:
            "Il design non riguarda soltanto l'aspetto visivo. Significa creare un'interfaccia e un'esperienza capaci di rendere il prodotto chiaro, coerente e semplice da utilizzare.",
          points: [
            "Interfaccia e linguaggio visivo",
            "Esperienza utente",
            "Comportamento responsive",
            "Pattern di interazione",
          ],
        },
        {
          number: "04",
          title: "Costruire",
          subtitle: "Trasformare l'idea in qualcosa di reale.",
          description:
            "Sviluppo il prodotto utilizzando le tecnologie più adatte al problema. L'attenzione è rivolta a un'architettura pulita, a un comportamento affidabile e a un codice capace di evolvere insieme al progetto.",
          points: [
            "Sviluppo frontend",
            "Backend e API",
            "Database e integrazioni",
            "Test e rifinitura",
          ],
        },
        {
          number: "05",
          title: "Affinare",
          subtitle: "Il lavoro continua anche dopo il lancio.",
          description:
            "Quando il prodotto funziona, guardo a ciò che può essere migliorato. Performance, usabilità, contenuti, aspetti tecnici e necessità future diventano parte della successiva iterazione.",
          points: [
            "Test e feedback",
            "Performance",
            "SEO e accessibilità",
            "Miglioramenti futuri",
          ],
        },
      ],
      closingTitle: "Nessun passaggio superfluo.",
      closingText:
        "Il processo si adatta al progetto. Un sito web semplice non ha bisogno dello stesso percorso di una web application complessa. Ciò che rimane costante è l'attenzione al problema, alle persone e al risultato.",
      ctaTitle: "Costruiamo qualcosa di utile.",
      ctaText:
        "Hai un'idea, un problema da risolvere o un processo che potrebbe funzionare meglio? Partiamo da lì.",
      ctaButton: "Parliamone",
    };
---

<section class="process-hero">
  <div class="process-hero-inner">
    <div class="section-label">
      <span>/ 01</span>
      <span>{content.label}</span>
    </div>

    <h1>{content.title}</h1>

    <p class="process-intro">{content.intro}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section
  class="process-phases"
  aria-label={isEnglish ? "Development process" : "Processo di sviluppo"}
>
  <div class="process-phases-inner">
    {
      content.phases.map((phase) => (
        <article class="phase">
          <div class="phase-header">
            <span class="phase-number">{phase.number}</span>

            <div class="phase-title">
              <span class="phase-subtitle">{phase.subtitle}</span>
              <h2>{phase.title}</h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="phase-body">
            <p class="phase-description">{phase.description}</p>

            <ul class="phase-points">
              {phase.points.map((point) => (
                <li>{point}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</section>

<section class="process-closing">
  <div class="process-closing-inner">
    <div class="section-label">
      <span>/ 02</span>
      <span>{isEnglish ? "The principle" : "Il principio"}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="process-closing-content">
      <h2>{content.closingTitle}</h2>

      <p>{content.closingText}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="process-cta">
  <div class="process-cta-inner">
    <div class="section-label">
      <span>/ 03</span>
      <span>{isEnglish ? "Start a project" : "Iniziamo un progetto"}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="process-cta-content">
      <h2>{content.ctaTitle}</h2>

      <div class="process-cta-bottom">
        <p>{content.ctaText}</p>

        <a href={isEnglish ? "/en/contact" : "/contatti"}>
          <span>{content.ctaButton}</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use "../styles/variables" as *;

  .process-hero,
  .process-phases,
  .process-closing,
  .process-cta {
    padding: 180px $container-padding;
    border-top: 1px solid $color-border;
  }

  .process-hero-inner,
  .process-phases-inner,
  .process-closing-inner,
  .process-cta-inner {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: $container-max-width;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;

    font-family: $font-mono;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: $color-muted;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 100px 0 0;

    font-family: $font-display;
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .process-intro {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 60px 0 0 120px;

    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: $color-muted;
  }

  .process-phases {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .phase {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 100px;

    padding: 100px 0;

    border-top: 1px solid $color-border;
  }

  .phase:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid $color-border;
  }

  .phase-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .phase-number {
    font-family: $font-mono;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: $color-muted;
  }

  .phase-title {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .phase-subtitle {
    font-family: $font-mono;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: $color-muted;
  }

  .phase-title h2 {
    margin: 0;

    font-family: $font-display;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .phase-body {
    max-width: 560px;
    padding-left: 120px;
  }

  .phase-description {
    margin: 0;

    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: $color-muted;
  }

  .phase-points {
    margin: 48px 0 0;
    padding: 24px 0 0;

    list-style: none;
    border-top: 1px solid $color-border;
  }

  .phase-points li {
    position: relative;

    padding: 12px 0 12px 20px;

    font-family: $font-mono;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;

    border-bottom: 1px solid $color-border;
  }

  .phase-points li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: $color-accent;
  }

  .process-closing-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.6fr;
    gap: 100px;

    margin-top: 100px;
  }

  .process-closing-content h2 {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0;

    font-family: $font-display;
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .process-closing-content p {
    align-self: end;
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0;

    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: $color-muted;
  }

  .process-cta-content {
    margin-top: 100px;
  }

  .process-cta-content h2 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;

    font-family: $font-display;
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .process-cta-bottom {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 60px;

    margin-top: 70px;
    padding-left: 120px;
  }

  .process-cta-bottom p {
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0;

    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: $color-muted;
  }

  .process-cta-bottom a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;

    flex-shrink: 0;

    font-family: $font-mono;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;

    color: $color-accent;
  }

  .process-cta-bottom a span:last-child {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    transition: transform $transition-fast;
  }

  .process-cta-bottom a:hover span:last-child {
    transform: translate(3px, -3px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .process-hero,
    .process-phases,
    .process-closing,
    .process-cta {
      padding: 120px $container-padding;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-top: 80px;
      font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 13vw, 6rem);
    }

    .process-intro {
      margin: 48px 0 0;
    }

    .phase {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;

      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .phase-header {
      grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .phase-title h2 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 11vw, 5rem);
    }

    .phase-body {
      max-width: 600px;
      padding-left: 68px;
    }

    .process-closing-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;

      margin-top: 80px;
    }

    .process-closing-content h2,
    .process-cta-content h2 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 12vw, 5rem);
    }

    .process-cta-content {
      margin-top: 80px;
    }

    .process-cta-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 40px;

      margin-top: 60px;
      padding-left: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .phase-body {
      padding-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
